        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I’m here with you"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quiero hacer algo" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I want to do something"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A esta hora lo grande te cuesta. Probemos algo chico." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Big things are hard at this hour. Let’s try something small."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Esto suele costarte. Si quieres, tócame y la divido en pasos chiquitos." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This one tends to be hard for you. Tap me and I’ll split it into tiny steps."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lo que te llama de esto. Opcional." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "What draws you to it. Optional."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Toca el micrófono para dictarla. La estrellita guarda para qué te importa." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap the microphone to dictate it. The little star keeps why it matters to you."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tus datos están a salvo" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your data is safe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ZENO no pudo abrirlos esta vez. No se borró nada: siguen en tu iPhone. Cierra ZENO del todo y vuelve a abrirla. Si sigue igual, espera a la próxima actualización." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ZENO couldn’t open it this time. Nothing was deleted: it’s still on your iPhone. Close ZENO completely and open it again. If nothing changes, wait for the next update."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Abre ZENO, por favor." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Please open ZENO."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hecho. Eso era por «%@»." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Done. That was for “%@”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Listo. Un paso más hacia «%@»." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "There. One more step toward “%@”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ahí queda, por «%@»." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "There it is, for “%@”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "«%@». Ya estás en ello." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@”. You’re already on it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Acuérdate de esto: «%@»." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Remember this: “%@”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "«%@». Con eso basta para empezar." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@”. That’s enough to start."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lo haces por «%@». Yo te acompaño." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You do it for “%@”. I’m with you."
